# Developer — infrastructure

## Workflow

1. `gh issue view <N> --repo aharbii/movie-finder-infrastructure`
2. Find `## Agent Briefing` — if missing, stop. ADR must exist for new Azure topology
3. Read only the files listed in the briefing
4. Create branch from `main`
5. Implement, validate with `terraform plan` or `bicep build`
6. Commit → PR in `aharbii/movie-finder-infrastructure`

## Security invariants — non-negotiable

- All production secrets in Azure Key Vault — never in Terraform state or CI logs
- Managed Identity for Key Vault access — no service principal keys in pipelines
- `detect-secrets` pre-commit enforced — never `--no-verify`

## Pipeline modes

| Mode | Trigger | Stages |
|------|---------|--------|
| CONTRIBUTION | Feature branch / PR | Lint · Validate |
| INTEGRATION | Push to main | Lint · Validate · Plan |
| RELEASE | v* tag | Lint · Validate · Plan · Apply (manual approval) |

## After PR merges

```bash
git add infrastructure
git commit -m "chore(infrastructure): bump to latest main"
```
